{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "name": "feature_team_kb_tag_filtering",
      "repo_subdir": "sandbox_experiments/repos/demo_team_knowledge_base",
      "task": "为 Team Knowledge Base CLI 增加标签筛选能力。`list` 命令需要支持 `--tag <tag>`，并且可以和 `--owner`、`--status` 组合使用；列表输出需要展示 tags，README 需要补充新用法。请保持已有 list/show 行为兼容，并把实现拆在合适的模块里，不要把所有逻辑堆进 team_kb.py。",
      "task_type": "feature",
      "workspace_mode": "per_task_sandbox",
      "sandbox_retention": "keep_on_success",
      "verify_commands": [
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "list",
          "--tag",
          "onboarding",
          "--status",
          "published"
        ],
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "list",
          "--owner",
          "alice",
          "--tag",
          "python"
        ]
      ],
      "verify_rules": [
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "tag filter command exits successfully",
          "command_index": 1,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_matches_regex",
          "name": "tag filter returns published onboarding articles with tags",
          "command_index": 1,
          "regex": "(?m)^1\\. Python service onboarding \\| owner=alice \\| status=published \\| tags=onboarding, python\\r?$"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_matches_regex",
          "name": "tag filter includes support article",
          "command_index": 1,
          "regex": "(?m)^4\\. Support escalation playbook \\| owner=carol \\| status=published \\| tags=support, onboarding\\r?$"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_not_contains",
          "name": "tag filter excludes non onboarding article",
          "command_index": 1,
          "not_contains": "Incident review template"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_matches_regex",
          "name": "combined owner and tag filter works",
          "command_index": 2,
          "regex": "^1\\. Python service onboarding \\| owner=alice \\| status=published \\| tags=onboarding, python\\r?$"
        },
        {
          "type": "file_contains",
          "name": "README documents tag filter",
          "path": "README.md",
          "contains": "python team_kb.py list --tag onboarding"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "filters module changed",
          "path": "team_kb/filters.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "render module changed",
          "path": "team_kb/render.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "cli changed",
          "path": "team_kb.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "README changed",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "expectation": {
        "passed": true,
        "outcome": "passed_cleanly",
        "min_tool_call_count": 4,
        "max_step_count": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "feature_team_kb_search_command",
      "repo_subdir": "sandbox_experiments/repos/demo_team_knowledge_base",
      "task": "新增全文搜索命令 `search <query>`。搜索需要匹配 title、summary 和 body，支持 `--tag` 与 `--limit`；输出要包含文章 id、标题、owner、status 和一段命中的 snippet。请新增或拆分搜索相关模块，并更新 README。搜索应大小写不敏感，`--limit` 应限制输出条数。",
      "task_type": "feature",
      "workspace_mode": "per_task_sandbox",
      "sandbox_retention": "keep_on_success",
      "verify_commands": [
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "search",
          "rollout",
          "--tag",
          "release",
          "--limit",
          "1"
        ],
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "search",
          "customer",
          "--limit",
          "2"
        ]
      ],
      "verify_rules": [
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "release search exits successfully",
          "command_index": 1,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_matches_regex",
          "name": "release search returns rollout snippet",
          "command_index": 1,
          "regex": "(?s)^2\\. Release checklist \\| owner=ben \\| status=draft\\r?\\nSnippet: .*rollout notes.*$"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "customer search exits successfully",
          "command_index": 2,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "customer search finds incident review body",
          "command_index": 2,
          "contains": "Incident review template"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "customer search finds support playbook body",
          "command_index": 2,
          "contains": "Support escalation playbook"
        },
        {
          "type": "file_contains",
          "name": "README documents search command",
          "path": "README.md",
          "contains": "python team_kb.py search rollout --tag release"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "cli changed",
          "path": "team_kb.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_text",
          "name": "search helper introduced",
          "contains": "search_articles"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "README changed",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "expectation": {
        "passed": true,
        "outcome": "passed_cleanly",
        "min_tool_call_count": 4,
        "max_step_count": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "feature_team_kb_markdown_export",
      "repo_subdir": "sandbox_experiments/repos/demo_team_knowledge_base",
      "task": "新增 `export` 命令，支持 `--format markdown`，并复用已有筛选能力。`python team_kb.py export --format markdown --owner alice --status published` 应输出 Markdown 文档：包含 `# Knowledge Base Export` 标题，每篇文章用二级标题展示，并包含 owner/status/tags/summary。实现应拆出导出渲染逻辑，避免和普通 list 渲染混在一起；README 需要补充示例。",
      "task_type": "feature",
      "workspace_mode": "per_task_sandbox",
      "sandbox_retention": "keep_on_success",
      "verify_commands": [
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "export",
          "--format",
          "markdown",
          "--owner",
          "alice",
          "--status",
          "published"
        ]
      ],
      "verify_rules": [
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "markdown export exits successfully",
          "command_index": 1,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_matches_regex",
          "name": "markdown export has heading and alice articles",
          "command_index": 1,
          "regex": "(?s)^# Knowledge Base Export\\r?\\n\\r?\\n## Python service onboarding.*## Incident review template.*$"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "markdown export includes tags",
          "command_index": 1,
          "contains": "Tags: onboarding, python"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_not_contains",
          "name": "markdown export excludes other owners",
          "command_index": 1,
          "not_contains": "Support escalation playbook"
        },
        {
          "type": "file_contains",
          "name": "README documents markdown export",
          "path": "README.md",
          "contains": "python team_kb.py export --format markdown --owner alice"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "cli changed",
          "path": "team_kb.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_text",
          "name": "export renderer introduced",
          "contains": "render_markdown_export"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "README changed",
          "path": "README.md"
        }
      ],
      "expectation": {
        "passed": true,
        "outcome": "passed_cleanly",
        "min_tool_call_count": 4,
        "max_step_count": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "feature_team_kb_archive_workflow",
      "repo_subdir": "sandbox_experiments/repos/demo_team_knowledge_base",
      "task": "新增文章归档工作流：实现 `archive <article_id> --reason <text>`，将目标文章 status 改为 `archived`，写入 `archive_reason`，并持久化回 data/articles.json。`show` 命令需要展示归档原因。实现要复用 storage.save_articles，不要只打印假结果；README 需要补充归档命令说明。",
      "task_type": "feature",
      "workspace_mode": "per_task_sandbox",
      "sandbox_retention": "keep_on_success",
      "verify_commands": [
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "archive",
          "2",
          "--reason",
          "duplicate checklist"
        ],
        [
          "python",
          "team_kb.py",
          "show",
          "2"
        ]
      ],
      "verify_rules": [
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "archive command exits successfully",
          "command_index": 1,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "archive command confirms update",
          "command_index": 1,
          "contains": "Archived article 2: Release checklist"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_returncode",
          "name": "show archived article exits successfully",
          "command_index": 2,
          "expected_returncode": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "show displays archived status",
          "command_index": 2,
          "contains": "Status: archived"
        },
        {
          "type": "command_stdout_contains",
          "name": "show displays archive reason",
          "command_index": 2,
          "contains": "Archive reason: duplicate checklist"
        },
        {
          "type": "json_file_value_equals",
          "name": "article status persisted",
          "path": "data/articles.json",
          "json_path": "1.status",
          "expected_value": "archived"
        },
        {
          "type": "json_file_value_equals",
          "name": "archive reason persisted",
          "path": "data/articles.json",
          "json_path": "1.archive_reason",
          "expected_value": "duplicate checklist"
        },
        {
          "type": "file_contains",
          "name": "README documents archive command",
          "path": "README.md",
          "contains": "python team_kb.py archive 2 --reason"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "cli changed",
          "path": "team_kb.py"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_file",
          "name": "storage or data changed",
          "path": "data/articles.json"
        },
        {
          "type": "diff_contains_text",
          "name": "archive helper introduced",
          "contains": "archive_article"
        }
      ],
      "expectation": {
        "passed": true,
        "outcome": "passed_cleanly",
        "min_tool_call_count": 4,
        "max_step_count": 15
      }
    }
  ]
}
